# Ignore virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
*/venv/
*/.venv/
**/venv/**
**/.venv/**

# Ignore everything by default
*

# Allow directories to traverse
!*/

# Allow Markdown documentation files
!*.md
!.gitignore

# Allow image files for README visualizations
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.svg

# Exclude virtual environment images/docs
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
